cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this skill, please cite it as below."
title: "ai-native-sdlc: a Claude Code skill implementing the AI-native SDLC playbook"
abstract: >-
  A Claude Code skill and plugin that runs software work through the AI-native
  SDLC loop (intent.md, spec.md, plan.md, build, verify, PR review, gated release)
  with human approval gates, guard hooks and a git-committed audit trail.
  Alpha release, aimed at regulated teams (fintech, payments, medtech). Unofficial implementation of Anthropic's "The AI-native SDLC playbook".
type: software
authors:
